    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: [_jsx(_components.strong, {
        children: "Establish ASR identification as a formal architectural activity"
      }), " rather than an ad-hoc process. Schedule quality attribute workshops during project inception, include ASR review in architecture governance checkpoints, and create templates or tools that make ASR documentation low-friction. Many teams integrate ASR catalogs into their architecture decision records (ADRs), creating explicit traceability from requirements to decisions. This formalization ensures ASR work receives dedicated time and attention rather than being perpetually deferred for \"more urgent\" tasks."]
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: [_jsx(_components.strong, {
        children: "Engage diverse stakeholders systematically"
